LanguageData.DepthRim.Voyage.OverboardText:
While {0} was under way, these were outside the hull. They could not keep up with the boat, were swept away by the current, and are now missing:

{1}

Keep everyone inside sealed compartments while under way.

LanguageData.DepthRim.Alert.PressureSickness.Desc:
These colonists are more than one pressure level away from what their bodies are used to:

{0}

They recover as their bodies adapt. To spare them, move them to a pressure chamber set within one level of their adapted level, then change the chamber one level at a time.
